###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#AUS_UNIT_01043_condition_c77c23
data:AUS_UNIT_01043_condition_c77c23 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                              owl:Thing ,
                                              cco:Condition ;
                                     cco:hasConditionExpression "if: the person is, or has been, a VET officer; and the person has obtained or generated personal information in his or her capacity as a VET officer; and the person: (i) uses the information; or (ii) discloses the information to another person. OR if the person uses personal information, and the information was disclosed to an agency, body or person under section 95; and the use of the information is not for a permitted purpose. OR if the person discloses personal information; and the information was disclosed to an agency, body or person under section 95; and either or both of the following apply:" ;
                                     rdfs:label "VET Officer or Section 95 Recipient Condition" ;
                                     prov:wasDerivedFrom data:AUS_UNIT_01043 .


