data:UK_UNIT_00216_action_9d54e1 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                          owl:Thing ,
                                          cco:Action ;
                                 cco:hasActionExpression "The provider has discussed with the employer and apprentice whether the apprentice will study towards a standalone English and/or maths qualification and has documented this decision; where a standalone qualification has been included, the provider has detailed how English and maths will be delivered in the training plan and has evidence of delivery taking place against that plan, in line with the active learning requirement." ;
