                                   "The role of a student receiving Canada Student Grant for Part-Time Studies." ,
                                   "The role of a student receiving financial assistance." ,
                                   "The role of an individual enrolled as a student in a post-secondary institution." ,
                                   "The role of an individual enrolled in an educational program seeking financial assistance." ,
                                   "The role of an individual enrolled in an educational program who may be eligible for financial assistance." ,
                                   "The role of an individual enrolled in an educational program, eligible for student financial assistance." ,
                                   "The role of an individual enrolled in an educational program, eligible to request funding and loan rehabilitation application reviews." ,
                                   "The role of an individual enrolled in an educational program." ,
                                   "The role of an individual enrolled in part-time or full-time studies at a designated educational institution." ,
                                   "The role of an individual enrolled in post-secondary education." ,
                                   "The role of an individual enrolled in post-secondary study." .


