                                  "An individual undertaking an apprenticeship programme." ,
                                  "An individual undertaking an apprenticeship, combining work with study under a formal training agreement." ,
                                  "An individual undertaking an apprenticeship." ,
                                  "The role of an individual undertaking an apprenticeship." .


